-	abstract = {Biosynthetic gene clusters ({BGCs}) are enticing targets for (meta)genomic mining efforts, as they may encode novel, specialized metabolites with potential uses in medicine and biotechnology. Here, we describe {GECCO} ({GEne} Cluster prediction with {COnditional} random fields;
